    "title": "BiteMe - Event & Food",
    "description": "Find and experience popular local events, food and restaurants. Get special recommended events and delicious food just for you.\r\nShare the events and invite friend to come with you. You can find varies events such as family salon, restaurant promotions, conferences and free event!\r\nEnjoy food and place online order anytime and anywhere from your mobile device.\r\nWith BiteMe - Event & Food, you can:\r\n- Find popular and recommended events.\r\n- Check what going on in future.\r\n- Share event with friends.\r\n- Get into event by just using your phone!\r\n- Browse your local restaurant and place online order.\r\n- Support ASAP and future order.\r\n- Bought gift card and use gift card to purchase event ticket and online pickup order.",
